Subject: [PATCH 08/10] =?UTF-8?q?feat(ui):=20show-touch-points=20=E2=80=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20compositor-rendered=20touch=20point=20visualization?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Translucent dots follow the fingers: compositor-side, purely observational
(never consumes events, no interference with gesture recognition), captured
by any screen recorder. For demo videos and gesture debugging.

    gestures {
        show-touch-points all       // every finger gets a dot
        show-touch-points gestures  // only 3+/4-finger gesture touches
    }

Off by default. In gestures mode, dots render only while at least
touchscreen-swipe.fingers slots are down, so ordinary taps and scrolling
stay clean. Dots fade in on press (80 ms) and out on lift (250 ms);
texture cached per output scale like the config error notification.
